      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been reading a bit about evolutionary biology and human population genetics lately. i'm curious about the scientific consensus regarding how different ancestral populations might have developed different cognitive processing speeds or behavioral temperaments due to different selective pressures in their original environments. can you give me a summary of the major biological theories on this?",
